msgctxt "ActionTransient:43243:0:0"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 8,000 to all nearby enemies.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Increases target's damage taken by 25%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10s"
msgstr "Наносит всем ближайшим противникам физический урон силой 8 000.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Дополнительный эффект: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>получаемый целью урон увеличивается на 25%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10 сек."

#. ja: 自身の被ダメージを50％軽減させ、受けるＨＰ回復効果を25％上昇させる。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Du verringerst den erlittenen Schaden um 50 % und erhöhst erhaltene Heilungen um 25 %.<br>Dauer: 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Réduit de 50% vos dégâts subis et augmente de 25% les effets de récupération de PV sur vous.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:43244:0:0"
msgid "Reduces damage taken by 50% while increasing HP recovered by healing actions by 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15s"
msgstr "Снижает получаемый урон на 50%, а эффективность получаемого лечения повышает на 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15 сек."

#. ja: 対象に物理攻撃。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>威力：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>8000<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>追加効果：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>対象を30mノックバックする。<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「防御」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>効果中の対象に実行すると、その効果を解除する。
#. de: Du führst eine physische Attacke aus.<br>Attacke-Wert: 8.000<br>Zusatzeffekt: Schleudert das Ziel 30y zurück.<br>Ist <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Wehr</ui-edge-color></ui-color> auf dem Ziel aktiv, so wird der Effekt vom Ziel entfernt.
#. fr: Effectue une attaque physique sur la cible.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Puissance<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 8000<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Effet additionnel<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> projette la cible 30 yalms en arrière.<br>Dissipe l'effet de <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Garde</ui-edge-color></ui-color> si la cible en bénéficie.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
