#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:43246:0:0"
msgid "Increases damage dealt by 25%, and converts 100% of damage dealt into HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10s"
msgstr "Повышает наносимый урон на 25% и превращает весь нанесённый урон в здоровье.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10 сек."

#. ja: 自身の移動速度を100％上昇させる。<br>さらに、浄化で解除可能な状態異常とノックバック、引き寄せの効果を無効化する。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>4秒<br>この効果はマウントに騎乗すると解除される。
#. de: Du erhöhst deine Be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>ge<shy>schwin<shy>dig<shy>keit um 100<nbsp>% und wirst immun gegen Rückstoß- und Heranzieheffekte sowie gegen alle Statuseffekte, die von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Purifikation</ui-edge-color></ui-color> aufgehoben werden können.<br>Dauer: 4 Sekunden<br>Rufst du ein Reittier herbei, wird dieser Effekt aufgehoben.
#. fr: Augmente de 100% votre vitesse de déplacement.<br>Vous protège contre les projections, les attractions, et les altérations d'état soignables avec Dépuration.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 4s<br>L'effet disparaît en cas de déplacement à dos de monture.
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:43247:0:0"
msgid "Increases movement speed by 100% and grants immunity to <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stun</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Heavy</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Bind</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Silence</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Deep Freeze</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, and knockback and draw-in effects.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>4s<br>Effect ends when riding a mount."
msgstr "Повышает скорость передвижения на 100% и даёт невосприимчивость к <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>оглушению</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>замедлению</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>обездвиживанию</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>немоте</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>глубокой заморозке</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, отбрасыванию и притягиванию.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>4 сек.<br>Эффект прекращается при посадке на маунта."

#. ja: 対象に物理攻撃。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>威力：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>6000～18000<br>このアクションは、対象が実行している防御の効果を無視してダメージを与える。<br>対象の残りＨＰが低いほど威力が上昇し、25％以下だと最大になる。<br>自身がノックアウトまたはアシストを獲得すると、このアクションのリキャストタイムが解消される。
#. de: Du führst eine physische Attacke aus, jeglichen Effekt von <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Wehr</ui-edge-color></ui-color> auf dem Ziel ignorierend.<br>Attacke-Wert: 6.000 bis 18.000<br>Attacke-Wert umso höher, je weniger LP dem Ziel verbleiben. Maximaler Wert wird ab 25<nbsp>% der Maximal-LP des Ziels erreicht.<br>Reaktivierungs-Timer wird entfernt, wenn du ein K. o. bewirkst oder dabei unterstützt.
#. fr: Effectue une attaque physique sur la cible.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Puissance<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> de 6000 à 18 000<br>Cette action inflige des dégâts sans tenir compte des effets de Garde dont bénéficie la cible.<br>La puissance augmente d'autant plus que les PV restants de la cible sont bas. Elle atteint son maximum lorsqu'il n'en reste que 25% ou moins.<br>Le temps de recharge est réinitialisé si vous comptabilisez une proie ou un soutien.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:43248:0:0"
msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 6,000.<br>Potency increases up to 18,000 as the target's HP decreases, reaching its maximum value when the target has 25% HP or less.<br>Ignores the effects of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Guard</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when dealing damage.<br>Recast time resets upon earning a kill or an assist."
msgstr "Наносит урон силой 6 000.<br>Чем меньше здоровья у цели, тем выше сила удара: максимум 18 000 при 25% здоровья или ниже.<br>При нанесении урона игнорирует эффект <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Защиты</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Перезарядка сбрасывается после убийства или оказания помощи при убийстве."

#. ja: 自身と周囲にいるパーティメンバーのウェポンスキルと魔法のキャストタイムとリキャストタイムを10％短縮させ、移動速度を33％上昇させる。<br>このアクションは遮蔽物を越えて効果を発揮する。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>12秒
#. de: Du verkürzt die (Re-)Ak<shy>ti<shy>vie<shy>rungs<shy>zei<shy>ten von Waf<shy>fen<shy>fer<shy>tig<shy>kei<shy>ten und Magie bei dir selbst und umstehenden Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>gliedern um 10<nbsp>%. Dazu erhöhst du deine und die Be<shy>we<shy>gungs<shy>ge<shy>schwin<shy>dig<shy>keit umstehender Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>glieder um 33<nbsp>%. Ignoriert Deckung.<br>Dauer: 12 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 33% la vitesse de déplacement et réduit de 10% les temps de lancement et de recharge des techniques d'arme et des sorts de magie, pour vous et les équipiers alentour.<br>Cette action n'est pas entravée par les obstacles.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:43249:0:0"
msgid "Reduces cast time and recast time of spells and weaponskills by 10%, and increases movement speed by 33% for self and nearby party members.<br>This action's effects extend through obstructions.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>12s"
msgstr "Сокращает время применения и перезарядки заклинаний и оружейных умений на 10%, а также повышает скорость передвижения на 33% для себя и ближайших участников отряда.<br>Эффект действует сквозь препятствия.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>12 сек."

#. ja: 自身またはパーティメンバーひとりを対象とする。<br>対象の与ダメージを25％上昇させ、被ダメージを25％軽減させる。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>効果時間：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>15秒
#. de: Du erhöhst den ausgeteilten Schaden und verringerst den erlittenen Schaden von dir oder einem Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>glied um jeweils 25<nbsp>%.<br>Dauer: 15 Sekunden
#. fr: Augmente de 25% les dégâts infligés et réduit de 25% les dégâts subis, pour vous ou l'équipier ciblé.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Durée<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:43250:0:0"
msgid "Increases damage dealt by a party member or self by 25%, and reduces damage taken by 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15s"
msgstr "Повышает наносимый урон себе или участнику отряда на 25% и снижает получаемый им урон на 25%.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15 сек."

#. ja: 対象に物理攻撃。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>威力：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>12000<br>このアクションは、対象が実行している防御の効果を無視してダメージを与える。
#. de: Du führst eine physische Attacke aus, jeglichen Effekt von <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Wehr</ui-edge-color></ui-color> auf dem Ziel ignorierend.<br>Attacke-Wert: 12.000
#. fr: Effectue une attaque physique sur la cible.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Puissance<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 12 000<br>Cette action inflige des dégâts sans tenir compte des effets de Garde dont bénéficie la cible.
